Wiki Page tables: a new width step "Medium" (1040px) between Text width and Wide, chosen like the other steps from the "Width" menu of the table toolbar; Wide is the layout width (1440px) again; a table wider than the text keeps a 10px margin to the sides of the content area; a pasted table with 6 or more columns becomes Medium, with 8 or more Wide, with 10 or more Full width. @reekitconcept
